        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 1e6d10fb-fdf7-4013-bf57-db2290b911b5).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47,\r\rYour target is famous chef Roberto Franculi who currently works as a personal chef for Omar al Ghazali in the Sceptre. He has been involved in numerous poisen incidents all across the globe and our sources say that he is planning on striking again in Dubai. He is not alone in this. His personal getaway pilot, Tommy Maverick, is also on scene to allow for a quick escape when the deed is done. Eliminate them both and save the clients of the Sceptre.\r\rGood hunting 47.",
